      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EXTRA VOLTAGE (4) was in the minors when resuming at this track where he finished second (17.55) in a Grade 4/5. Goes very well here finding the frame in each of six starts. Boasts three wins from four starts out of this box. One of the leading chances. MOSTLY SAVAGE (2) goes very well this trip starting 22 times for eight wins and 10 minors. Was out of placings last time (17.57) at this track in a Free For All, finishing fourth and beaten 3 lengths. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts. BUNDY BLUE (6) goes very well this course and distance starting six times for three wins and two minors. Missed the frame latest (23.16) when fourth over 400m at The Gardens in a Grade 4/5. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts. MISS TWIX (1) is worth consideration.",
